# validators/
# This folder will contain express-validator validation chain arrays.
# Validators are used as middleware before controller handlers.
#
# Planned validators (Phase 2+):
#   authValidator.js       - Registration and login field validation
#   contactValidator.js    - Contact form field validation
#   teamValidator.js       - Team member data validation
#   joinValidator.js       - Join application field validation
#   sponsorValidator.js    - Sponsor application field validation
